Z||000002||Oreif||11-28-2000||01:50 AM||||HMM he's looking at 10" subs now. Wonder if it finally came to him he couldn't fit 2 12's in 1.5 cu ft box?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  From his message he doesn't sound like the "expert" he thought he was. <BR>Now that he's not on here anymore, Lots of people during that thread complimented me on how I tactfully handled it. Well the secret was I used "Dilbert's Office Rule #12"<P>"Never argue with an idiot, The drag you down to their level and beat you with experience"<P>LOL  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
